  "plain_text": "Language for this entry\nOverride language, timezone, and keyboard settings for this startup entry only.\nEmpty fields keep the image defaults.\nAccepted values\nLocale uses a locale name such as ru_RU.UTF-8.\nTimezone uses an IANA name such as Europe/Moscow.\nKeyboard layout uses an XKB layout code such as us or ru.\nCompletion\nSuggestions come from locale, timezone, and keyboard data installed in the\ncurrent system. A suggestion helps with spelling but does not add missing\nlocale data to the built image.",
